{"id":"en_unruly-crown-princess-a-journey-beyond-worlds","title":"Unruly Crown Princess： A Journey Beyond Worlds","titleEn":"Unruly Crown Princess： A Journey Beyond Worlds","description":"Jenny Miller, a scientist from the modern era, finds herself transported into the world of a book while playing a game, where she takes on the role of crown princess. She soon discovers that the crown prince is likewise a traveler from another time. The two learn that locating a third traveler is the only way for them to get back to the modern world, so they set off together on an adventure through this unfamiliar realm. For those interested in following how the story unfolds, Dramzio is one place where the series can be watched.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/unruly-crown-princess-a-journey-beyond-worlds/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/unruly-crown-princess-a-journey-beyond-worlds/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Time Travel","Scumbag-punishing","Misunderstanding","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d49cg/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_unruly-crown-princess-a-journey-beyond-worlds_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d49cg/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unruly-crown-princess-a-journey-beyond-worlds_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d49cg/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_unruly-crown-princess-a-journey-beyond-worlds_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d49cg/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false